# Edit the CRON-style schedule below to control when the display turns on and off.
# Each entry is separated by a semicolon and must end with either "on" or "off".
# Fields follow the standard "minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week" format.
# The default schedule powers the display on at 08:00 and off at 18:00, Monday through Friday.
DISPLAY_POWER_SCHEDULE="0 8 * * 1-5 on;0 18 * * 1-5 off"
